793
01:05:12,544 --> 01:05:17,024
来增强该流程，从而更快、更准确地获得结果。
that it can use to enhance that process and get to your result faster and more accurately.

794
01:05:17,198 --> 01:05:18,704
这就是 DBS 框架。
And this is the DBS framework.

